        <mxCell id="DDUVB4_bk2qrmLTNgyuY-164" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=0;align=left;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Montserrat;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;*Válida que un registro no esté cargado de forma previa en el aplicativo&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Montserrat;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;*&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Válida los Datos que se incorporan en la “descripción” del concepto de la factura&lt;br&gt;electrónica, conforme la regla &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;(RNA036):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Válida que el campo “número de operación” no contenga datos distintos y que no este vacio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Válida que&amp;nbsp;el campo “fecha de presentación” contenga datos de tipo fecha y no este vacio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; - Valida que el campo&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 10pt; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;“hora de presentación”&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 13.3333px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;no contenga datos distintos y que no este vacio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 13.3333px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; - Valida que el campo&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: justify; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;“clave concepto del pago”&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 13.3333px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;no contenga datos distintos y que no este vacio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Montserrat;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;mso-ansi-language:ES-MX;mso-fareast-language:ES-MX;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;*Válida que no existan errores en registros pertenecientes a datos agrupados conforme&lt;br&gt;la &lt;b&gt;(RNA021)&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Montserrat; font-size: 13.3333px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:17.15pt;text-align:justify;mso-pagination:&amp;lt;br/&amp;gt;none;tab-stops:383.75pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
